      "statement": "The agent graph is a plain LangGraph flow. The ask path runs: resolve subjects (first turn, detection or learner pick) → search via MCP (fixed step, top-5 chunks) → relevance gate (code) → growth check (code, adds a subject if score meets threshold and thread has < 3 subjects) → answer (streamed, with citations) or decline.",
